1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,999
[Music] Ephesians 2:8 – You are saved by grace through faith.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,999
Praise be to Jesus Christ, to our Lord Jesus, and thanks to our Holy Mother of Kreupasanam.

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,999
My name is Nisha Raja, and this is my husband, Raja Augustine. We are settled in Gujarat.

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:41,999
We are members of St. Ann’s Church, Junagadh. We have been married for 20 years, but we had no children.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:54,999
After our marriage in 2004, in December 2005, I completed nine months of pregnancy and delivered a baby boy, but he was stillborn.

6
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:10,999
After that, I had six miscarriages, four D&amp;Cs, three laparoscopic surgeries, two hysteroscopies, and one IVF at Amrita Hospital.

7
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:22,999
But all the results were zero. We went through many treatments. We even have medical files from 22 doctors.

8
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,999
From Amrita Hospital we got a reference.

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:38,999
And so we went to a very famous hospital in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, where we consulted the main doctor himself.

10
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:46,999
The doctor attended to us and said, “You are a challenging case for me, but I will give you results.

11
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,999
You are my personal patient.” The doctor was very confident, and seeing that gave us a lot of hope.

12
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:01,999
We continued with the treatment happily, but still, no results came. Finally, even the doctor had no more words.

13
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:07,999
Once when we went to Ahmedabad, I carried the covenant salt with me.

14
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,999
When still no results came, we realized that the doctor could do nothing more.

15
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:24,999
So, on July 11th, 2022, we came to Kreupasanam for the first time and took the covenant.

16
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:31,999
We received the covenant articles and that time when we returned to Gujarat, we carried with us the rosary, covenant medal, and the covenant newsletters.

17
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:39,999
As soon as we reached Junagadh parish, we met our parish priest and told him about taking the covenant.

18
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:48,999
He was very happy and supported us spiritually. Our parish has about 45 families.

19
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:55,999
Out of those, 43 are Goans and Kannadigas. Only three families are Malayalees.

20
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:03,999
The covenant newsletters in my hand was in Malayalam, and I worried about how to explain about Mother of Kreupasanam, to them.

21
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,999
I was very troubled thinking about this, and I prayed to Mother,

22
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:14,999
“Mother, please give us a testimony here, please grant us a witness here. These people lack faith.

23
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:23,999
Please give a testimony here.” And we received three testimonies. One of them was about a person on a ventilator.

24
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:30,999
We got the testimony, and we were overjoyed. We experienced that Mother was with us.

25
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:37,999
In October, three families came here to take the English covenant.

26
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:44,999
Thus, we fully immersed ourselves in covenant life. We grew spiritually.

27
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:54,999
We attended daily Mass, prayed the covenant prayers, did covenant meditations, engaged in works of mercy,

28
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:05,999
and prayed using the covenant oil. In September 2023, we came to Kerala.

29
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:15,999
When we came, we renewed the covenant. Even then, we were still in great distress.

30
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:21,999
That time we had the blessing of meeting Reverend Father Joseph.

31
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:32,999
Father gave us the Mother’s medal and told us to place it under the pillow. He also gave us oil and

32
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:38,999
told us to apply it on the lower abdomen and pray. Father placed his hands on our heads and prayed, saying,

33
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:44,999
“A child born of your own blood will be given to you. You will testify.”

34
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:55,999
We believed completely at that very moment. That time when I returned to Gujarat, I bought a big baptism candle.

35
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:02,999
I placed it in my cupboard where I could see it every day, and I prayed daily to the Blessed Mother:

36
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:10,999
“Mother, when will I enter the church carrying this candle? When will you give us joy?

37
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:17,999
How long must we wait?” I prayed earnestly, asking, “Mother, please grant us the blessing to see the face of our child.”

38
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:21,999
I prayed to Mother especially with this intention.

39
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:29,999
Thus, we lived our covenant life exactly as Father instructed, in faith and faithfulness.

40
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:38,999
It was fulfilled for us. After 11 months, I conceived, just as Father had messaged.

41
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:50,999
In August, I conceived. I was in Kerala then, but we did not know I had conceived. We continued living our normal life.

42
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:58,999
Then in October, we went for the Rosary Rally. Before that, Father had sent the message, and a few days later,

43
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:11,999
I had a dream. In that dream, I saw the Kreupasanam Mother. Around Mother, there were many children. Among them, she extended one beautiful child into my hands. I took the child and went away.

44
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:16,999
That was the dream. But the Mother I saw in the dream was not exactly the same as the face of Mother on the altar.

45
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:22,999
There was a little difference, as though she appeared slightly older. Still, I believed.

46
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:27,999
I shared both the dream and the message that Father had conveyed from Mother with everyone.

47
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:33,999
We had stopped all treatments by then. Many people told us,

48
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:42,999
“You should continue treatment, you should see doctors, you should go again to these Fathers so he can lay his hands and pray.”

49
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:48,999
But we stood firm with just one conviction: “We have Kreupasanam Mother’s message through Father Joseph.

50
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:53,999
We will receive a child. We already have a child.” That was our assurance, and we boldly told everyone.

51
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:56,999
We were that confident.

52
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,999
So we also joined the Rosary Rally.

53
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:08,999
In 2023, when I came for the Rally, I saw the decorated statue of Mother, and I was filled with joy.

54
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:16,999
I realized that this was the very Mother I had seen in my dream, and my faith became stronger. “Surely, Lord, my child will come.”

55
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:23,999
At that time, I did not yet know I was pregnant, but my faith was firm, that seeing this Mother assured me of the child.

56
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:31,999
After the Rally, we received the good news that I was indeed pregnant.

57
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:38,999
From December onwards, every Sunday, my husband and I attended the covenant meditation here.

58
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:47,999
We both came together for three months, until mid-March. After that, my husband came alone to complete it.

59
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:57,999
Always I prayed to Mother: “Mother, I am not the one who is pregnant — you are. The child is in your womb. This is your child.”

60
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:04,999
From then on, I prayed seeing the Kreupasanam Mother as a pregnant Mother.

61
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:09,999
Mother blessed us and guided our journey forward.

62
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:14,999
We went for check-ups at a hospital in Ernakulam, which was a branch of the Gujarat hospital.

63
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:23,999
All our check-ups went well. At seven months, I was given injections to strengthen the baby’s lungs.

64
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:27,999
Because of that, I had a fluid discharge.

65
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:38,999
We were deeply troubled and cried to Mother in prayer. My husband took up a fasting prayer for 100 days.

66
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:42,999
That fasting prayer ended only after the delivery. Every day we prayed, clinging to the Kreupasanam Mother.

67
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,999
We prayed daily using the covenant oil.

68
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:54,999
I never missed even one day of Mass during pregnancy. Every day I went to church, without fail.

69
00:08:55,000 --> 00:09:01,999
Later, we called the main doctor in Ahmedabad and told him everything.

70
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,999
The doctor said, “For delivery, go to the parent hospital.”

71
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:14,999
So, after eight months, we went to Gujarat and got admitted there. They did a sonography.

72
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:22,999
The doctor, a Hindu doctor, already knew this was a naturally conceived pregnancy.

73
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:27,999
The doctor was very happy.

74
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:34,999
After examining me, the doctor consulted with another doctor. Based on the sonography results,

75
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:41,999
they said they had planned a caesarean, but since this was a special case,

76
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,999
they would try for a normal delivery.

77
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:55,999
On the third day after admission, on April 23rd at 12:10 pm, I had a safe normal delivery. Mother blessed us with a healthy baby boy. That day was also my birthday.

78
00:09:56,000 --> 00:10:01,999
So this boy was the birthday gift that Mother gave me.

79
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:12,999
The baby was kept in the observation ICU for just one day. The doctor who attended to me...

80
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:22,999
The doctor has experience of 5,000 caesareans and 10,000 normal deliveries.

81
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:38,999
After the delivery, when my husband went to see the doctor, the doctor said, “In my 44 years of practice—even after attending so many deliveries—your case is unique.”

82
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:46,999
The doctor also said, “Your God has saved you.”

83
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:55,999
He told my husband that besides this, we have received many other blessings.

84
00:10:56,000 --> 00:11:03,999
Three years ago we had put a piece of property up for sale, and it was sold.

85
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:13,999
Also, an eight-year-old court case of ours was settled this month.

86
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:26,999
These are part of our testimony — Mother has given us many blessings. I am only mentioning the most important ones here.

87
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:34,999
As part of our apostolic work while we were in Gujarat, we distributed newsletters.

88
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:38,999
Later we began distributing them in English, Hindi, and Gujarati.

89
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:51,999
Our parish has a total of 110 members. With Father’s permission, I placed a picture of Mother of Kreupasanam in the grotto at our church.

90
00:11:52,000 --> 00:12:01,999
That gave everyone the opportunity to pray to the Mother. We distributed medals and newsletters to everyone.

91
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:12,999
We also distributed rosaries. Of the 110 people, at least 25 can be seen wearing Mother’s rosary when they come to church.

92
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:24,999
They all now know about Kreupasanam Mother and they pray. We brought and gave them the English Covenant Prayer book.

93
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:31,999
We taught them the prayer; they now watch the testimonies on YouTube.

94
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:38,999
During my pregnancy, we mainly took the newsletters to government hospitals and gave them out.

95
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:47,999
There we would first ask people, “Have you heard about Mother of Kreupasanam?” — and then I would... (show my pregnancy belly and share my testimony).

96
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:53,999
I would show my belly and say, “This is the blessing Mother gave me after 20 years.”

97
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:02,999
After saying that, I would give them the newsletter. Then I would also ask, “Will you read it?” Only if they said yes, I would give it.

98
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:12,999
After that I would add, “If you read this and believe in it, if you believe in Mother, you will not remain sick, you will not need to come to the hospital.”

99
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:19,999
“When your sickness is healed, you must surely come to Kreupasanam,” I would remind them.

100
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:32,999
In my sixth month, we distributed 10 bundles of newsletters. In the seventh month, 15 bundles. In the eighth month, 22 bundles. We proclaimed Mother and shared our testimony.

101
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:42,999
We proclaimed faithfully. We also gave newsletters to all the Fathers and Sisters who came to our parish.

102
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:54,999
When Bishop Jose Chittooparampil of Rajkot came to our parish, we told him, “This is the child given to us through the blessing of Mother of Kreupasanam.”

103
00:13:55,000 --> 00:14:00,999
Hearing this, the Bishop said, “I too know about Kreupasanam.” That gave us great joy.

104
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:13,999
In the same way, whenever Fathers came—whether Provincial or Vicar General—we would give them newsletters and share our testimony.

105
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:26,999
Many Sisters also came as guests, from different states and countries. We would give them medals and say, “Wherever you go, give this to others. They will receive Mother’s blessing.”

106
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:31,999
This is how we carried out our mission work.

107
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:43,999
We also grew spiritually. By attending daily Mass and prayer, our parish priest gave us opportunities to conduct First Friday Adoration.

108
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:57,999
In works of mercy, we would provide lunch in the cancer ward of the General Hospital.

109
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:05,999
We also prepared and served snacks in old age homes.

110
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:11,999
We helped lonely people in whatever way they needed.

111
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:17,999
What gave us the most joy is that people recognized that we have compassion.

112
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:24,999
They approached us for help, and whatever they asked, we did for them, always saying it is God who provides.

113
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:31,999
We gave thanks to Jesus and to Kreupasanam Mother for everything.

114
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:49,999
Isaiah 66 – The Lord declares: “Shall I bring to the point of birth and not give delivery? Shall I, who give life, close the womb? says your God.”

115
00:15:50,000 --> 00:16:01,999
Dear ones in Jesus, this is the great grace given to this daughter and her family.

116
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:12,999
Who else has ever received such a gift—that on the very day of the mother’s birthday, the child is born?

117
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:20,999
That was the gift given. On Mother’s birthday, the child was born.

118
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:31,999
This is what Mother did for them—through their faith, faithfulness, dedication, and every mission work they carried out.

119
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:41,999
They explained everything—how much they tried to make God known to others, and to deepen the faith of those who already believed.

120
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:47,999
That is why Mother gave them this gift. Their works were seen by Jesus and Mother.

121
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:55,999
It is Jesus and Mother who gave this great gift.

122
00:16:56,000 --> 00:17:04,999
They have shared and made us understand everything. This great gift will never be forgotten.

123
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:13,999
It is Holy Mother who gave them this great joy, this great gift.

124
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:19,999
And through this, she is preparing them to reach eternal life.

125
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:23,999
That is why they will continue to come and share their testimony.

126
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:32,999
To be witnesses—they have told the Bishop, the people, the whole region. They will not keep quiet anymore; they will tell everyone.

127
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:40,999
They bought rosaries for the people there, so that when they walk wearing the rosary of Mother of Kreupasanam, it is known that Kreupasanam has reached there too.

128
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:46,999
They distributed medals, gave written prayers, and carried out this ministry in Kreupasanam.

129
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:55,999
In doing so, the Holy Spirit never left them.

130
00:17:56,000 --> 00:18:02,999
This is mission work—making others know and deepening their faith.

131
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:11,999
This is part of the Covenant. When they did this faithfully, Holy Mother and Jesus lifted them up to glorify God.

132
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:18,999
Let us now thank Jesus with countless thanks and clap our hands, remembering how He brought them to this altar.

133
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:26,999
Extraordinary divine experiences can also become yours.

134
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:33,999
If you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe now.

135
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:38,000
Share this video with your friends and become missionaries of the Lord.
